  "solution": "Given:\n\n108 ÷ 18 × 3 - 64 × 2 ÷ 32 + 80 ÷ 5 of 4\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n108 ÷ 18 × 3 - 64 × 2 ÷ 32 + 80 ÷ 5 of 4\n\n⇒ 108 ÷ 18 × 3 - 64 × 2 ÷ 32 + 80 ÷ 5× 4\n\n⇒ 6 × 3 - 64 × 0.0625 + 4\n\n⇒ 18 - 4 + 4\n\n⇒ 18\n\n**∴ The required answer is 18.**",
